<title>UK: BGL sets 2.5 bln escudo seven-year bond. [corrected 16:30 gmt]</title>
<headline>BGL sets 2.5 bln escudo seven-year bond. [corrected 16:30 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline from &quot;BIL&quot; to &quot;BGL&quot;.)</p>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banco Santander de Negocios Potugal.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE GENERALE DU LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> AMT    2.5 BLN PTE   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    2004</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    26.FEB.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 S&amp;P	  AA-	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES    **11.85 MINUS 6M LISBOR PAID SEMI-ANNUALLY IN THE</p>
<p>		FIRST YEAR AND 6.25 PCT ANNUALLY THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		ISSUER HAS CHANCE TO REDEEM AT PAR AT THE END OF</p>
<p>		EVERY YEAR.</p>
<p>		ISSUED UNDER EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
